    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HORNY HOLIDAY is a short  visual novel focusing on one hot woman. The game is a free roam experience packed with comedy and romance for adults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jack, who meets the attractive Joy at a holiday housewarming party, and make the decisions as you try to win her heart. Your choices shape the story. In the finale of the game, you have a chance to be rewarded with good sex if you get the happily ever after ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's in The Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 female love interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20K words and over 1500 HD images  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different positions in HD uncensored animated sex scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point &amp; click interactions, free roam sandbox style exploration with optional fun mini-games </p></li></ul>",
